<title>TAIWAN: Cathay Construction '96 pretax up 61 pct.</title>
<headline>Cathay Construction '96 pretax up 61 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-December 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover				8,131 vs 5,650</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 2,067 vs 1,282</p>
<p>NOTE - Cathay Construction Company is Taiwan's largest construction firm.</p>
<p>At a board meeting, the company proposed a T$1.6 dividend per share for 1996, including a cash dividend of T$1 per share and a stock dividend, or bonus issue, of T$0.6 per share, the firm said in a statement.</p>
<p>The proposal needs shareholders' approval at a meeting slated for May 23, it said.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
